# OpenTofu working directories and any state that lands locally by mistake.
# State lives in the cell's own regional backend, never in the tree: it holds
# endpoints and identifiers for a cell, and a copy in git is a copy in every
# clone. The provider lock files (.terraform.lock.hcl) of the roots under
# tofu/envs are committed; a module's lock file is not, because a module does
# not choose provider versions — the root that instantiates it does.
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
backend.hcl
tofu/modules/**/.terraform.lock.hcl

# Rendered kustomize output from local checks.
kubernetes/rendered/
